  "usage": {
    "scroll_scrub": "Map scroll progress 0..1 (or a looping 0..1) to frame = ((Math.round(progress * total_frames) % total_frames) + total_frames) % total_frames. When the frame falls in a chunk, seek that chunk to local_frame = frame - start_frame. Because GOP is 8 and there are no B-frames, seeking is cheap. Preload the current + next chunk. Use the mobile tier under a width/dpr breakpoint. If a browser cannot scrub MP4 reliably, the JPEG zip covers only chunk 00 (scene 1) as a limited fallback.",
    "concatenation": "Chunks are contiguous and complete: chunk n last frame + 1 == chunk n+1 first frame, total 2014 frames, no overlaps or gaps."
  },
